 "remarks": "Charming and updated 2-bedroom apartment ideally located just minutes from I-95, Noroton Heights Train Station, Darien Commons, and Heights Crossing, with fantastic shopping, dining, and everyday conveniences right nearby. This inviting apartment offers two dedicated off-street parking spaces, plus a private fenced patio perfect for grilling, outdoor dining, or relaxing. The patio connects directly to your own private porch and entrance. The open-concept first floor features a full kitchen with a granite counter-height peninsula, generous cabinet storage, and a bright, sun-filled living room. A natural-gas fireplace creates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, while a convenient coat closet and half bath complete the first floor. Upstairs, you'll find two bedrooms with ceiling fans, new wall-to-wall carpeting, and a full bathroom featuring a glass-and-tile shower. The standout laundry room includes a new full-size front-loading washer and dryer, a spacious folding counter, and plenty of cabinet storage. A large double closet provides additional storage just across the hall. New blinds have been installed throughout the apartment, adding a fresh, finished touch to every room. Additional amenities include central air conditioning and heat, a fire sprinkler system, new combination smoke and carbon monoxide detectors, full-home generator, and shared EV car charger. A wonderful blend of Victorian character, modern updates, private outdoor space, and commuter-friendly convenience",
